  "notes": "Fort Lee is a fully developed borough with zero vacant land. DCA calculated prospective need of 382; Borough proposed 360; settled with NJBA at 366. Prior Round obligation = 180 units; Third Round obligation = 427 units. 107 affordable units completed across prior/third round projects (family rental, special needs, senior). VLA resulted in 4th Round RDP of 30 units from 4 approved redevelopment projects. Unmet need = 366 - 30 = 336 units. Borough satisfies unmet need through Borough-wide MSO (10% set-aside, 5+ units per §410-86E(1)) and redevelopment designations. Candidate snapshot had 4 sites that were Phase-1 guesses: Upper/Lower Main Street Redevelopment (Block 4355, different lot numbers than verified); Center Lofts and 2 Executive Drive — none of these match the VLA RDP table in the adopted HEFSP. The plan's VLA table identifies 4 different sites at Blocks 5952, 6451, 7151, and 4454. Also: study area at 453-459 Main St (Block 4551, Lots 3,4,5,6) not yet a committed site.",
